Q: cvc-complex-type.3.2.2: Attribute &#39;local&#39; is not allowed to appear in element &#39;ref&#39;.	root-context.xml A: <p>Remove "local" from your code It is no more allowed in Spring</p>

<pre><code>&lt;property name="velocityEngine"&gt;
    &lt;ref local="velocityEngine"/&gt;
&lt;/property&gt;
</code></pre>

Q: How to responsive image in ionic from different screen size? A: <p>I also got this issue. This code might help to you <br><br>
HTML</p>

<pre><code>    &lt;div class="list card new-feeds wall-post"&gt;
    &lt;div class="row"&gt;
        &lt;div class="col"&gt;
            &lt;div class="item item-image img4"&gt;
                &lt;img src="img/hard.png"&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class="item item-image img4"&gt;
                &lt;img src="img/soft.png"&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class="item item-image img4"&gt;
                &lt;img src="img/welcome.png"&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class="item item-image img4"&gt;
                &lt;img src="img/title.png"&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>css</p>

<pre><code>.wall-post .img4 {
    width: 50%;
    float: left;
    height: 120px;
}
.img4 &gt; img {
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
